{"title": "Lathander's Blessing", "pageid": 28134, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Lathander's_Blessing", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Lathander's Blessing</b> is a passive feature that protects the wielder should they fall in combat.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>, when your hit points are reduced to 0, you regain <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>. Allies within 9 m (30 ft) also regain <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Blood_of_Lathander\" title=\"The Blood of Lathander\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Blood_of_Lathander\" title=\"The Blood of Lathander\">The Blood of Lathander</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Lathander's Blessing does not activate if the wielder is not in the active party. For example, a companion who is left at <a href=\"/wiki/Campsite\" title=\"Campsite\">camp</a> and receives damage via <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Warding_Bond\" title=\"Warding Bond\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/25px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/38px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/50px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Warding Bond\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/25px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Warding_Bond\" title=\"Warding Bond\">Warding Bond</a> which reduces their hit points to zero does not cause this effect to trigger.</li>\n<li>Lathander's Blessing does not protect against being shoved, thrown, or otherwise forcibly displaced into chasms.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Lathander's Blessing does not heal allies of the wielder, but rather only active party members nearby.\n<ul><li>Due to the way the heal is coded, the attacker who triggered Lathander's Blessing is considered to be the source of the healing. As a result, the healing will not trigger on-heal effects such as <a href=\"/wiki/Blessed_Mercy\" title=\"Blessed Mercy\">Blessed Mercy</a> from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Whispering_Promise\" title=\"The Whispering Promise\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Ring_F_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Whispering_Promise\" title=\"The Whispering Promise\">The Whispering Promise</a> when equipped by the wielder.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Due to an incorrectly set <code>TargetConditions</code> field, the additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> affects the wielder in addition to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>.</li>\n<li>Due to a timing limitation caused by the method in which healing is applied, the wielder may not always receive all of the healing they are stated to have received in the combat log; they often receive only <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> (from being stabilized) or <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>, rather than the stated <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d6+2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>. It is also possible for the wielder to receive healing, yet still remain dead, showing their lootable corpse with remaining hitpoints.</li>\n<li>Due to a missing technical condition (<code>MAG_LATHANDERS_TRACKER</code>) resulting from The Blood of Lathander being spawned in-game via a \"Local Item\", this passive's \"Once per Long Rest\" cooldown only refreshes for the wielder during a Long Rest. Equipping the weapon on another character that did not wield the weapon during a Long Rest does not allow this passive to trigger. Additionally, Lathander's Blessing is not reset when consuming a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber\" title=\"Potion of Angelic Slumber\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber\" title=\"Potion of Angelic Slumber\">Potion of Angelic Slumber</a> or when affected by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Intervention:_Opulent_Revival\" title=\"Divine Intervention: Opulent Revival\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp/30px-Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp/40px-Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Divine Intervention: Opulent Revival\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Intervention:_Opulent_Revival\" title=\"Divine Intervention: Opulent Revival\">Divine Intervention: Opulent Revival</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201417\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.080 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.090 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3885/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 42101/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 22151/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 963501/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   77.694      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   77.694      1 -total\n 35.88%   27.873      7 Template:DamageText\n 34.73%   26.987      9 Template:Icon_link\n 33.91%   26.350     64 Template:Trim\n 33.46%   25.994      9 Template:Icon_text\n 31.26%   24.286      7 Template:Damage_type\n 22.75%   17.675      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 22.00%   17.092      3 Template:Item_icon\n 19.81%   15.388     15 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28134-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201417 and revision id 361153. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}